{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>曾在劇集《家族榮耀》中飾演「馬來娣」而為觀眾熟知的潘藝桐（Pearl），今年5月驚喜宣布獲男友求婚成功後，日前終於正式步入婚姻殿堂，在香港鄉村俱樂部舉行浪漫婚禮！名媛好友「燈芯絨大王」千金江鈺琪（Yuki）亦親臨現場見證，並在社交平台分享一對新人在舞池共舞的甜蜜片段，場面浪漫動人！</p><figure><img alt=\"潘藝桐（右）在《家族榮耀》中飾演郭政鴻和熊黛林的小女兒。（劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220211/568859932460322816142638.jpeg/DRe-OiO1UNZ5BVWmd5L6z0kF6nFIWzzf4kkPi-JJD4s\"/><figcaption>潘藝桐（右）在《家族榮耀》中飾演郭政鴻和熊黛林的小女兒。（劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"今年5月驚喜宣布獲男友求婚成功。（小紅書圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260501/1126857475937931264847609.jpeg/fWkZa2_eETp5P8kf24G_AS4y_Ky8wDdCOfZ4sDn2eLA\"/><figcaption>今年5月驚喜宣布獲男友求婚成功。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"今年5月驚喜宣布獲男友求婚成功。（小紅書圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260501/1126857468136132608714635.jpeg/eH7uquv7D-zGY632I5Nf-J2iM2F2V0ppPHS0ODx0tDg\"/><figcaption>今年5月驚喜宣布獲男友求婚成功。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"婚照。（小紅書圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171900544353570816572308.jpeg/KJeOHd86oR-0a_9sAErdL7G0jzX8RPH0ulz5gLpc-YA\"/><figcaption>婚照。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"婚照。（小紅書圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171900532898533376680712.jpeg/IPy9qHuj5g7eniKSTMI4P4tsoI9Ah_pCnZ9nyZ2fZ8k\"/><figcaption>婚照。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"婚照。（小紅書圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171900530616700928859172.jpeg/mErfoQsFThvX9iK1CEHhqgCU_7kCeCOBh4QB-IeEAfg\"/><figcaption>婚照。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>華麗水晶燈下跳First Dance　新郎公主抱新娘轉圈場面浪漫</p><p>從江鈺琪分享的現場短片可見，婚禮會場佈置極盡奢華，天花懸掛著多盞巨型璀璨水晶吊燈及純白垂幔。潘藝桐換上一襲銀白色閃鑽刺繡修身晚裝，將長髮半紮起，高貴仙氣，新郎Chris則身穿白色西裝禮服配黑色長褲，在全場賓客的見證與掌聲下，一對新人走到舞池中央跳起浪漫「First Dance」，兩人先是優雅轉圈，隨後新郎更將潘藝桐高高抱起，新娘雙手環抱老公頸部，仰頭展露燦爛幸福大笑，甜度爆燈！</p><figure><img alt=\"高貴優雅。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322015132717056823904.png/TB7YfquccyFUYHc6qurzE6VijTqRxC-lYveoxWL3qMU\"/><figcaption>高貴優雅。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"高貴優雅。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322012825718784403651.png/UhKRQmdpJd0o8nkpjtfUxaPwdUGKtUWH-19mWPtfZlg\"/><figcaption>高貴優雅。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"浪漫婚禮。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322010690686976075613.jpeg/w3lCKmJ2Ng1T311PkIbRdWyqH2IX2KRxMQG6HjEBuh4\"/><figcaption>浪漫婚禮。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一對新人走到舞池中央跳起浪漫「First Dance」。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322019671216128782159.jpeg/dvrrGUvKo4uI7BGTtiZMgEzGD9iafJ0_0yRLiNMkS4g\"/><figcaption>一對新人走到舞池中央跳起浪漫「First Dance」。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"轉圈。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322017401966592810376.jpeg/7SGPY-7jx9Fzee-F3G2PU3VRATt7Pwl8Ei-aFBIvmhQ\"/><figcaption>轉圈。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"拖手。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322015317266432712064.jpeg/HDKM8wHYmwmN4ZjYXpHKuqzZCyJb_brcvULdW71C3Vs\"/><figcaption>拖手。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"公主抱轉圈！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198325830892130304451869.jpeg/w7RnKa2IZWV283FZarye2yFXgVc0WOZwTiwqIk4sKiI\"/><figcaption>公主抱轉圈！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場佈置。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322010816516096105637.jpeg/vfiJpjeFKyHJs-XOVlug4N4AuThuVa-UaNKLKGjSiyg\"/><figcaption>現場佈置。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場佈置。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322020661071872740319.png/-_nFI5jD-7eqf3F82_EM_l8VUseDCp68L_jEuS_4xLk\"/><figcaption>現場佈置。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>無敵海景草地證婚　潘藝桐與老公深情擁吻</p><p>除了晚宴盛況之外，出席婚禮的親友亦於社交平台分享多張證婚美照，在無敵大海景及繁花佈置的戶外儀式上，潘藝桐身穿一襲純白U領緞面拖尾婚紗配長頭紗，手捧淡黃色馬蹄蓮花球，高貴優雅，一對新人深情擁吻，場面十分浪漫！</p><figure><img alt=\"無敵大海景。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322018295353344605948.jpeg/ilmwK-tK5YUsh7eyEuvqILberhtxEMSX1_vIzdf7yM0\"/><figcaption>無敵大海景。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"深情擁吻。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322016395202560564831.jpeg/hGw6z-yuvCV0hLLFoYUkK86kz4cYMF9zj1OG449ThuM\"/><figcaption>深情擁吻。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"姊妹團。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322014344056832921375.jpeg/6pThmxB7t8su1DzTtNK5odRzudmFMmmaisf_XIrH_1w\"/><figcaption>姊妹團。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夢幻婚禮！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322012288716800643207.jpeg/0SbMVBQtaypW0xuAdREQsDtcFJLqxrIAoxlQ96MZUPc\"/><figcaption>夢幻婚禮！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>曾是Angelababy（楊穎）同門師妹的潘藝桐，因顏值出眾及擁有一雙超圓大眼而被封為「貓眼美少女」，更是一名學霸才女。家境富裕的潘藝桐中學就讀名校德望學校，13歲隻身遠赴英國求學，畢業於倫敦瑪麗女王大學（Queen Mary University of London）商業管理系，在學期間已與同學合作開設婚禮及活動策劃公司，並擔任行政總裁（CEO）。潘藝桐大學畢業後曾到上海戲劇學院進修戲劇，及後曾在深圳擔任戲劇老師，2019年以素人嘉賓身份參加內地戀愛真人騷《心動的信號2》，成功吸引關注，之後被Kim（周優根）睇中正式簽約入行，生意頭腦極好的她更曾投資過百萬做美容院生意，如今正式榮升人妻，吸引大批網民留言祝賀！</p><figure><img alt=\"榮升人妻。（小紅書圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171900536836984832217850.jpeg/50O1h7HTdp4UCz-LSdAPFBh0ExjlGTbh4e-s0-HvrNM\"/><figcaption>榮升人妻。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"巨型鑽戒！（小紅書圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171900539613745152850612.jpeg/RDo_owExem2Wi1rpgkmkU4vWKiQ9uuDYEAOaNRADmjU\"/><figcaption>巨型鑽戒！（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好靚。（小紅書圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171900542075932672617320.jpeg/IqZ6XsTiD-_o3T1Ckjfkeor-luC-E_YEC4E9NwuBPTc\"/><figcaption>好靚。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"過大禮。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171900826936283136389104.jpeg/YIIjiOxn-ez1Um5SMi16xB3J_Xh-hvdyM7iS0zO4ktM\"/><figcaption>過大禮。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"婚紗look。（IG@pearlpoon）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322558253404160641780.jpeg/FtbL2ZSROtq7hJE6D17aFwelcYqEVMLzL912wi_ddsI\"/><figcaption>婚紗look。（IG@pearlpoon）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"五官精緻。（IG@pearlpoon）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322555862519808956431.jpeg/qQpT2QfTe4CcWz44nPhBPDpOIgHrfIXPUVsIh1FbCIc\"/><figcaption>五官精緻。（IG@pearlpoon）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靚靚新娘。（IG@pearlpoon）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322553303863296720986.jpeg/p2oQb31SmvX_KjLuwUnqI3QSPMpOYD9ffwMLWX8DC1k\"/><figcaption>靚靚新娘。（IG@pearlpoon）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"簽紙。（IG@pearlpoon）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322550489354240549638.jpeg/hj0aNWkICXlX4-1j703zNgoYCzrx6IBgZCz3RGQs90Q\"/><figcaption>簽紙。（IG@pearlpoon）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好浪漫。（IG@pearlpoon）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198322548132024320751234.jpeg/s5rqRY8kcUb7gqw2fDwmSEbtOLXM6xQWEUtXWhFLV1o\"/><figcaption>好浪漫。（IG@pearlpoon）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T10:23:25.812491+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1236,"images":28,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T10:00:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T11:17:39.151799+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T10:16:53.225880+00:00","content_hash":"01454f27f8dd36c508025ba3fc4c41b30b94ebad91e34039cf8137405851473a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}